text:        Im surprised no one else is talking about just how unreliable and volatile AI is. Half the time I ask I get a error. Gemini says its having problems, ChatGPT and Claude say they’re at capacity. Kimi just fails silently. And even if it does answer it can either be what I expect or way worse like a lobotomized model
text_en:     
literal_zh:  我很惊讶居然没人聊 AI 到底有多不稳定、多能抽风。一半时间我问下去直接报错。Gemini 说它自己出问题了，ChatGPT 和 Claude 说他们满负载了。Kimi 干脆静默失败。就算它真回了，要么是我要的，要么差得离谱像个被阉割的模型。
